2026Friday, May 29, Page 1 [There is a photo]
The vitality of local development policies in the new era is being demonstrated day by day. Dear Comrade Kim Jong-un said the following at the new local industrial factories that have emerged amidst the party’s benevolence..
《local standard of living, The degree of civilization of a region is established as an important measure of the degree of development of our style of socialism..》
The vitality of local development policies in the new era is being demonstrated more and more every day..
With the intention of actively contributing to improving the people's lives, the officials and workers of new local industrial plants that have risen up under the party's benevolence are focusing on developing new products and improving quality, and are sounding the same note of production..
The workers and employees of the Unsan-gun Food Factory are creating more new products that are unique to their region., We are waging a vigorous struggle to produce higher quality products..
The factory makes pine nut candy using pine nuts that are common in the region., pine nut shavings, It produces various pine nut processed products, including pine nut snacks, and is well-received by the military community..
The factory workers were not satisfied with this and decided to produce a more nutritious and tasty product., We are carrying out a planned variety expansion project while deepening research to produce specialty products that represent the county..
In addition, quality competition, We are deeply committed to the party's intention to actively engage in development competition and are putting great effort into ensuring that employees fulfill their role as owners of new product development and quality improvement projects..
《National Food Exhibition-２０２６》Various exhibitions held in Pyongyang city and province, including, Technician at the fair, We actively encourage skilled workers to participate and learn about new product development results and experiences from other regions and units..
In particular, with the goal of making pine nut processed products an exclusive indicator that brings out the characteristics of the region, we are actively conducting a technological innovation movement by actively exploring ways to further improve the quality in cooperation with the relevant scientific research units..Meanwhile, a reasonable pine nut processing method was discovered to further improve the taste and quality of the product and to produce nutritious pine nut juice., We are making substantial progress in our business to develop new products, including pine nut porridge..
The number of products continues to increase due to the great enthusiasm of those who want to release at least one more popular product that can compete with the central product..
Active technology competition to increase variety
The workers and employees of the Hamju-gun daily necessities factory focused on developing new products with the enthusiasm to contribute to improving the lives of the people in the county, and achieved the result of increasing the number of products by 10 times the number at the time of operation..
They are fanning the flames of technological innovation under the view that the number of products must be constantly increased in order to satisfy the diverse needs of the people in the county..Various injection molding machines and molding machines, Dozens of new types of molds were manufactured and installed and powdered soap was manufactured., face soap, shampoo, We are significantly increasing production by establishing a new rinse production process..
Recently, we have laid the foundation for improving the quality of wood products by remodeling our facilities based on our own technological capabilities..
The factory frequently organizes competitions in which all employees participate, and actively promotes feasible new ideas so that they can lead to great results..In addition, we operate the science and technology supply office effectively so that employees can acquire and actively utilize new technologies in their fields..
Meanwhile, we are regularly holding technical review meetings at least once a month while strengthening the technical capabilities of factories and increasing the demand for them to come up with at least one technological innovation plan that contributes to quality improvement and new product development..
Today, the factory has the foundation to produce household resin products, consumer goods needed to improve the lives of citizens, and resin pipes of various specifications as desired..
Now, without being arrogant about the achievements they have made, they continue to strive with the goal of increasing the number of products to more than 100 by accelerating the development of new products..
Actively engaging in socialist competition, the Seongcheon-gun clothing factory was divided into separate work groups., We are actively engaging in socialist competition among skilled trades..
Now, factory workers and employees are focusing on improving quality and diversifying products., We are striving to realize diversification so that citizens can fully experience the vitality of our party's new era local development policy..
Factory workers are deeply mindful of the importance of heightening the competitive atmosphere in pushing forward unit development and are carrying out this project with the right methodology..
In particular, the competition outline is written correctly and the summary and evaluation are done according to the actual situation..
Installed at the production site in the factory TVDaily production performance of all employees is disclosed on the screen and work group competition meetings are held weekly., In February, a factory-level socialist competition meeting is held to heighten the public's enthusiasm for competition..
As a result, employees are working hard to improve their technical skills, and their parents and siblings are working hard to improve their technical skills., We put the utmost care into each product as if we were dressing our children..
Also, at the factory, a draftsman, We are carrying out projects methodically in various formats to increase the demand for technical preparation staff to come up with clothing designs that suit the tastes and preferences of residents and that are refreshing to look at, while broadening their perspective..
During this process, the factory produced many clothing products and sent them to workers in charge of major construction projects, including military construction brigades, and made strides in clothing processing technology and new product development..
The workers and employees of the factory, which has produced dozens of new products this year and received positive reviews from residents, are not arrogant about their achievements and are further escalating socialist competition to revitalize production..
Headquarters Reporter Choi Hyeon-kyung
-In Jeongpyeong-gun- -In Sinpo City- -At the Euncheon-gun food factory- -At the Jangyeon-gun food factory-
